    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "# Google Sheets Agent — Employee Records (sub-workflow)\n## Start (passthrough trigger)\n\nReceives { query } — a natural-language employee-record request from the parent.\n\n## Google Sheets Management AI Agent1\n\nSystem prompt routes intent → one of 4 tools below; instructed to ask for missing required fields rather than guess before an Append.\n\n## Get row(s) in sheet in Google Sheets1\n\nNo filters defined (filtersUI: { values: [] }) — returns all rows; the agent itself filters/searches within the result set.\n\n## Append row in sheet in Google Sheets1\n\nWrites a new row: Emplyee ID (sic — sheet header literally has this typo), Name, Age, Department, Email, Contact — all values resolved via $fromAI.\n\n## Update row in sheet in Google Sheets1\n\nMatches on Emplyee ID column (matchingColumns: [\"Emplyee ID\"]) to find which row to overwrite.\n\n## Delete rows or columns from sheet in Google Sheets1\n\nDeletes by startIndex + numberToDelete, both $fromAI-resolved numbers — riskier than ID-based deletion since it's positional.\n\n## Groq Chat Model3\n\nLLM backing the agent — llama-3.3-70b-versatile.\n",
        "height": 1024,
        "width": 640,
        "color": 4
      },
